<title>GERMANY: Suedzucker raises 1996/97 dividend.</title>
<headline>Suedzucker raises 1996/97 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend per ordinary share		 17   vs 15.50 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend per preference share	     19   vs 17.50 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Suedzucker AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
